#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/transport.md:1
msgid "General Transport Scientific Classes"
msgstr "通用 Transport 科学类"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/transport.md:3
msgid "This reference covers all 4 certificate-backed scientific classes in `relic.scientific.transport`: 4 executable concrete Functors, 0 fail-closed unavailable boundaries, and 0 abstract contracts. Each entry is generated from the live class, its IPHS certificate, State Contract Model, and ParameterManager metadata. Fail-closed unavailable classes are not instantiated during documentation generation."
msgstr "本参考覆盖 `relic.scientific.transport` 中全部 4 个 certificate-backed scientific class：4 个可执行 concrete Functor、0 个 fail-closed 不可用边界与 0 个 abstract contract。每个条目均依据 live class、IPHS certificate、State Contract Model 与 ParameterManager metadata 生成。文档生成期间不会实例化 fail-closed 不可用类。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/transport.md:5
msgid "The tables distinguish constructor controls, runtime variables, and ParameterManager scientific parameters. Values shown as package defaults belong to the documented RELIC architecture version and must not be copied as hardcoded constants into scientific code."
msgstr "各表区分 constructor 控制项、runtime variable 与 ParameterManager 科学参数。所示 package default 属于该 RELIC 架构版本，不得复制为科学代码中的硬编码常量。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/transport.md:7
msgid "Certificate wildcard parameter groups (`*`, `<pft>`) are expanded to their exact current YAML entries. Every other declared parameter is matched to the parameter database by its exact full key; a declared name is never mapped to a key that merely ends with the same name."
msgstr "证书中带通配符的参数组（`*`、`<pft>`）会展开为当前 YAML 中的精确条目。其他声明参数均按完整键名与参数数据库精确匹配；不会将声明名称映射到仅以相同名称结尾的键。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/transport.md:9
msgid "Exact ParameterManager rows report the live YAML value, bounds, gradient policy, description, and provenance. A row whose value reads `not declared in the parameter database` is intentionally not assigned an invented default: the class metadata or certificate declares the quantity, with the meaning and units it states, but the parameter database has no key of that exact name."
msgstr "精确匹配的 ParameterManager 行展示当前 YAML 值、边界、梯度策略、说明和来源。值标为 `not declared in the parameter database` 的行不会被赋予编造的默认值：类元数据或证书声明了该量及其含义和单位，但参数数据库中没有完全同名的键。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/transport.md:11
msgid "IPHS levels are read from the sole certificate owner. Levels 1 to 3 describe compatibility, wrapping, or declared structure; they are not strict IPHS/GENERIC claims."
msgstr "IPHS level 只从唯一的 certificate owner 读取。Level 1 至 3 分别表示 compatibility、wrapping 或 declared structure，不构成 strict IPHS/GENERIC 声明。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/science/transport.md:13
msgid "The Channel column of each runtime output contract applies `relic.core.state.types.partition_outputs`, the only runtime output channel classifier, to the declared output name. A name that the classifier reserves for diagnostics, such as `diagnostics.*`, goes to the diagnostics channel and is never committed as state. For any other name the channel is decided at run time by the write mode of the returned value: `StateWriteMode.DERIVED` routes the output to the diagnostics channel, and any other write mode sends it to the StateManager commit (a value without a write mode takes the run's semantic-mode rules or the StateManager schema). The generator does not run `forward()`, so it does not predict that write mode. The Kind column is the State Contract Model kind of the variable and does not set its channel."
msgstr "各运行时输出契约的通道列将唯一的运行时输出通道分类器 `relic.core.state.types.partition_outputs` 应用于声明的输出名称。分类器保留给诊断的名称（如 `diagnostics.*`）进入诊断通道，不会作为状态提交。其他名称的通道由返回值的写入模式在运行时决定：`StateWriteMode.DERIVED` 将输出送入诊断通道，其他写入模式则将其送交 StateManager 提交（没有写入模式的值遵循本次运行的语义模式规则或 StateManager 模式）。生成器不执行 `forward()`，因此不会预测该写入模式。种类列表示变量在状态契约模型中的种类，不决定其通道。"

