msgid "Maximum fixed-point (Picard) iterations of the implicit midpoint and Crank-Nicolson transport steps (functional._integrate_rate_system); exhausting it raises RuntimeError and never returns an unconverged state. The map y <- y_n + dt f((y_n + y)/2) (theta = 1/2 for Crank-Nicolson) contracts with q = (dt/2) L, L being the infinity-norm Lipschitz constant of the semi-discrete rate, so about ln(tol)/ln(q) iterations reach the increment tolerance transport.numerical.implicit_midpoint_tolerance (1e-10). L = \\|u\\|/dx for central advection, 2\\|u\\|/dx for upwind and 4K/dx^2 for diffusion give q = C/2, C and 2 sigma (C = \\|u\\| dt/dx, sigma = K dt/dx^2). 50 covers q <= 0.6: central advection over the whole documented range C <= transport.numerical.cfl_advection_max = 1, upwind up to C = 0.6 and diffusion up to sigma = 0.3 (probe of 2026-09-23, 64-cell periodic step profile, both methods: at most 30 iterations for central at C = 1, 41 for upwind at C = 0.6 and for diffusion at sigma = 0.3). At q >= 1 (upwind at C = 1, diffusion at sigma = transport.numerical.cfl_diffusion_max = 0.5) the iteration cannot converge for any limit and the step raises; reduce dt. Changed from 4 on 2026-09-23: 4 converged only for q up to about 0.01 (for example central advection failed at C = 0.1, which needs 8 iterations); converged steps are unchanged because the iteration returns its first converged iterate. Distinct from computation.solvers.implicit_midpoint.max_iterations and computation.solvers.crank_nicolson.max_iterations, the solvers own defaults for callers that pass no configuration; the transport kernel always passes this value."
msgstr "隐式中点和 Crank-Nicolson 输运步的最大不动点（Picard）迭代次数（functional._integrate_rate_system）；耗尽次数会抛出 RuntimeError，不会返回未收敛状态。映射 y <- y_n + dt f((y_n + y)/2)（Crank-Nicolson 的 theta = 1/2）的压缩因子为 q = (dt/2) L，其中 L 是半离散速率在无穷范数下的 Lipschitz 常数，因此约 ln(tol)/ln(q) 次迭代可达到增量容差 transport.numerical.implicit_midpoint_tolerance（1e-10）。中心平流的 L = \\|u\\|/dx、迎风平流的 2\\|u\\|/dx 和扩散的 4K/dx^2 分别给出 q = C/2、C 和 2 sigma（C = \\|u\\| dt/dx，sigma = K dt/dx^2）。50 次可覆盖 q <= 0.6：中心平流覆盖文档所列完整范围 C <= transport.numerical.cfl_advection_max = 1，迎风平流覆盖至 C = 0.6，扩散覆盖至 sigma = 0.3（2026-09-23 的 64 单元周期阶跃剖面探针，两种方法均测试：中心平流 C = 1 时最多 30 次，迎风平流 C = 0.6 和扩散 sigma = 0.3 时最多 41 次）。q >= 1 时（迎风平流 C = 1，扩散 sigma = transport.numerical.cfl_diffusion_max = 0.5），无论上限设多大，迭代都无法收敛，时间步会报错；应减小 dt。此值于 2026-09-23 从 4 改为 50：4 次仅在 q 不超过约 0.01 时收敛（例如中心平流在 C = 0.1 时失败，需要 8 次）；已收敛时间步的结果不变，因为迭代返回首次收敛结果。它不同于 computation.solvers.implicit_midpoint.max_iterations 和 computation.solvers.crank_nicolson.max_iterations，后两者是求解器为未传入配置的调用方提供的默认值；输运内核始终显式传入此值。"

